    "media:imagetext": "MAIN COURSE\nPlease select one of the options below\nPan Fried Chicken with Lemon Caper Piccata Sauce with haricots verts and fresh\nricotta tortelloni\nServed with finocchiona salami and goat cheese appetizer* and little gem salad with\nsmoked pecans, pomegranate seeds, parmesan cheese and Caesar dressing\n*appetizer contains pork\n( Four Cheese Caramelle Pasta with smoked fontina sauce and porcini mushroom\nbolognese with tomatoes\nServed with finocchiona salami and goat cheese appetizer* and little gem salad with\nsmoked pecans, pomegranate seeds, parmesan cheese and Caesar dressing\n*appetizer contains pork\nMixed Greens with Rosemary Grilled Shrimp tomatoes, red onion, roasted corn, red\nand yellow bell pepper with balsamic vinaigrette\nServed with Butternut Squash soup\nDESSERTS\nOCTOBER 2019\nVanilla Ice Cream served with chocolate sauce\nFruit \u0026 Cheese Plate Cypress Grove Midnight Moon, Kaltbach Gruyère and\nButtermilk Blue Affinee, with fresh fruit and crackers\nALMOST THERE\nWarm Chocolate Chip Cookie\nSince 2005. Deila emplovees, customers and their friends and families have raised $16.7\nmillion for BCRE including last vear's efforts of $2.1 million. The collective contributions\nhave funded the vital work of 58 different research projects in the pursuit of eradicating\nbreast cancer. To learn how you can support, visit delta.com/BCRF.\n• Vegetarian",
